{\b JHYY Installer License Agreement}{\b0\par}
{\b Version 1.5.0}{\b0\par}
\par

{\b English}{\b0\par
JHYY (JiHuiYiYou) is a self-hosted, statically-typed programming language with its own compiler.\par
\par
This installer distributes the JHYY compiler binary (jhyy.exe), the QBE IL compiler (qbe.exe), and a subset of binutils (as.exe, ld.exe, cc1.exe, collect2.exe) required for linking.\par
\par
JHYY compiler is released under MIT License. See repo LICENSE for full text.\par
\par
QBE is vendored under its own MIT-style license (see qbe/LICENSE).\par
\par
binutils (as.exe / ld.exe / cc1.exe / collect2.exe) are extracted from MSYS2 ucrt64 distribution, licensed under GPLv2+/GPLv3+. See https://www.gnu.org/licenses/ for full text.\par
\par
NO WARRANTY. THIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS".\par
\par}

